# Mosquitto ACL（最小权限）
#
# 约定的用户名（由 docker-compose 的 mosquitto-init 创建）：
# - edge_api
# - edge_daq
# - ai_softsensor
# - edge_monitor
#
# Topic 约定（与代码默认一致）：
# - realtime/<LINE>/tags
# - system/<LINE>/status
# - system/<LINE>/alarms
# - system/bootstrap
# - ai/<LINE>/...
# - control/<LINE>/tags
# - control/<LINE>/acks
# - events/system/self_heal

user edge_api
topic read $SYS/#
topic read realtime/+/tags
topic read system/+/status
topic read system/+/alarms
topic read ai/+/# 
topic read control/+/acks
topic write control/+/tags

user edge_daq
topic read control/+/tags
topic write control/+/acks
topic write realtime/+/tags
topic write system/+/alarms

user ai_softsensor
topic read realtime/+/tags
topic write ai/+/moisture

user edge_monitor
topic write system/+/status
topic write system/bootstrap
topic write events/system/self_heal


